  textComponent: {fileID: 0}
  nameComponent: {fileID: 0}
  sentences:
  - Awesome! You found your wallet! My job here is done. I'm glad I could be of some
    help.
  - Thanks for helping me out.
  - To be honest...
  - I didn't think you would go out of your way to help me find my wallet.
  - My friends had this bad encounter with the police and distrust them.
  - But I'm glad I didn't let them influence me.
  - I realised how kind-hearted and how you geniunely care about about this negihbourhood
    and the safety of people.
  - Aw shucks! You're being too kind!
  - This is just what I do and my responsiblity as a police officer.
  - I hope your friends can come to trust and accept the police as well. We are suppose
    to be the protectors afterall.
  - Oh yeah! There is a coffee with a cop session this weekend. Bring your friends
    along and we could talk it out.
  - I will.
